WEBVTT

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:04.694
Screen three steps with READY: repeatability, explicit rules,

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.533
assessable output, dependable tools and a yes-or-no human

00:00:08.668 --> 00:00:11.632
takeover boundary. Preparing a reminder from confirmed details

00:00:11.946 --> 00:00:14.401
may be a bounded test candidate. Stopping reminders

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:17.276
and routing a dispute needs an explicit rule

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.542
and actual tool evidence. Resolving the dispute remains

00:00:21.677 --> 00:00:25.742
human-led. Record evidence and gaps for every check.

00:00:26.348 --> 00:00:31.041
Then use CARE to inspect clarity, access, reliability,

00:00:31.288 --> 00:00:35.467
effort and evidence. These are screening decisions, not

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:37.621
permission to deploy live automation.
